dimensions). If it is a natural photograph (e.g., a portrait), the sharp
2D-peak predictions are expected to FAIL, which is a valid falsification of
the operator claim on a real image. If it is a structured pattern, the test
will show whether directional analysis rescues the resonance prediction that
